# Project rules for every agent session. Full entry point: AGENTS.md.

- NEVER call any external AI or translation API (no LLM/model/HTTP endpoints).
  You translate yourself in this chat; only the offline tools in tools/ may run.
- Never edit Data/*.lua in a translation round; the loop STOPS before the merge.
- Never invent text; segmentations must build the source line back byte for byte.
- Read first: AGENTS.md, then translation/PIPELINE.md.
- New data round: before ANY translation run
  python3 tools/select-untranslated.py ... and python3 tools/make-batches.py,
  then work batch by batch with the checks (verify-segmentation/validate-batch).